The official change log is now on the XTF wiki:

    http://xtf.wiki.sourceforge.net

2025.10.21:
    Updated to run on Tomcat 10 and Java 21. Updates will probably run using as old as JDK 8, but that has not been tested.

    Details:
        Ran "javax2jakarta -profile=EE" from Apache Tomcat to update to jakarta namespace where required
        Updated all lib jars to the latest version possible. See the VERSIONS file in the lib directory for more information

        Refactored several classes to use the latest jars
        Refactored to resolve all "Deprecated and Marked for Removal", as well as all "Deprecated" Warnings to avoid unexpected failures in the future.

        Added Mozilla library java port (juniversalchardet-2.5.0.jar) to test for jTidy input encoding to improve workflow. Defaults to utf-8 if detection fails. Improved invalid character handling on output.
            TODO: html should also be saved as lazy files.

        Added testing for marc encoding (utf-8, marc8, ISO-8859-1), now checks for .marc, .mrc, .marc8 extensions.
            TODO: marc can be indexed and searched, but display dosn't work. Browser just downloads the entire indexed marc file. 
            There should be style sheets for marcXML indexing and display, and binary marc files should be saved as marcXML. They are converted for indexing anyways.
            Various formats of marc files should be included in the sample data.

    TODO: there are many "unchecked / unsafe" compiler warnings due to the older code base. At least the highest priority warnings should be refactored.
